  "name": "Calm Trend, Fast Exit",
  "thesis": "The core entries (above the 50-day with volatility under 25%, a 1.35-sigma dip above the 200-day, a close back over the 50-day) with a faster exit: it sells the first close under the 20-day mean that is not oversold instead of waiting for the 50-day, or when volatility passes 50%; 4.2% stop, 7% target, 5% trailing stop, 13 sessions, two-session wait.",
  "entry_rules": [
   {
    "when": "close > sma50 and vol20 < 0.25",
    "weight": 1.0,
    "note": ""
   },
